OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'cold-blooded
OL,4,Arevenge' van attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who mowed down a man in a
OL,7,F"cold-blooded revenge" attack has been
OL,8,Fjailed.
OL,10,FRicky Lee Wayne Murphy, 30, struck
OL,11,Fpedestrian Danny Brennan with his van
OL,12,Fin Prescott Road, Carlisle, on 4
OL,13,FJanuary, leaving him with a significant
OL,14,Fand life-changing brain injury.
OL,16,FCarlisle Crown Court heard how there
OL,17,Fhad been a dispute between the two
OL,18,Fbefore the hit-and-run attack, where
OL,19,FBrennan was thrown into a brick pillar
OL,20,Fwhich broke under the impact of his
OL,21,Fhead hitting it.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
