OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'cold-blooded
OL,4,Arevenge' van attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury unanimously found Murphy, of
OL,7,FFerguson Place, guilty of grievous
OL,8,Fbodily harm with intent and he was
OL,9,Fjailed for nine years.
